Changes in version 1.1.9001 (2026-09-28)
+ Version bumped from 0.99.0 to 1.1.9001 so this fork is distinguishable from
  the 0.99.0 namespace-only RiboseQC stub that the nf-core/riboseq ORFquant
  container used to ship.  Both printing "0.99.0" made a failed install look
  identical to a successful one.  Bioconductor devel numbering: the current
  release is 1.1, so ".9001" marks this as an unreleased development version.
+ Functional changes are in git log, not enumerated here: deterministic
  k-means (kmeans3) in P-site offset selection, optional BPPARAM / genomic
  window based parallel BAM analysis, faster metagene and P-site profile
  building.

Changes in version 0.99.0 (2018-05-15)
+ Submitted to Bioconductor